{"song_id": 10953225, "title": "Sinode Pibouin (Insurrection-Non-Violente)", "language": "fr", "lyricists": [55334], "lyrics": [{"section_id": "section_0", "type": "intro", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Sinode Pibouin", "rhyme": ")", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Sinode Pibouin", "rhyme": ")", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Sinode Pibouin", "rhyme": ")", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Si...", "rhyme": "i", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "- \"C'est toujours la religion du Stup, ils ont pas \u00e9volu\u00e9s du tout, c'est encore la m\u00eame chose, mais moi j'en ai marre !\"", "rhyme": "aR", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "- \"Jo\u00ebl ? Approche-toi\"", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "6", "text": "- \"Oh !\"", "rhyme": "o", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "7", "text": "- \"Viens par ici\"", "rhyme": "i", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "8", "text": "- \"Oui ?\"", "rhyme": "i", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "9", "text": "- \"Mais croyais-tu sinc\u00e8rement que la religion du Stup pouvait s'\u00e9teindre ?\"", "rhyme": ")dR", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "10", "text": "- \"Mais non ma\u00eetre, jamais je n'ai eu de telles pens\u00e9es !\"", "rhyme": "e", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "AAABCDEBBFG", "rhyme_vowel": "AAABCCDBBAE"}, {"section_id": "section_1", "type": "couplet", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Ils ont choisi la peur pour manipuler nos gens", "rhyme": "#", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Ils sont d\u00e9complex\u00e9s, calculateurs et diligents", "rhyme": "#", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Leur arrogance luit telle un astre malsain", "rhyme": ")", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Ils tracent leur ch\u0435min sans se soucier du bien commun", "rhyme": "(", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "L\u0435s cocmocr\u00e9as sont tous en passe de r\u00e9ussir", "rhyme": "iR", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Nous les ch\u00e2tierons mais il est trop t\u00f4t pour se r\u00e9jouir", "rhyme": "iR", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "6", "text": "Unissons nos forces dans un ultime effort", "rhyme": "OR", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "7", "text": "B\u00e2illonnons les hy\u00e8nes qui pr\u00f4nent la loi du plus fort", "rhyme": "OR", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "AABCDDEE", "rhyme_vowel": "AABCDDEE"}, {"section_id": "section_2", "type": "refrain", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, r\u00e9union des fid\u00e8les", "rhyme": "El", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, pour cr\u00e9er l'\u00e9tincelle", "rhyme": "El", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, saluons nos confr\u00e8res", "rhyme": "ER", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, commen\u00e7ons la pri\u00e8re", "rhyme": "ER", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, r\u00e9union des fid\u00e8les", "rhyme": "El", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, pour cr\u00e9er l'\u00e9tincelle", "rhyme": "El", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "6", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, saluons nos confr\u00e8res", "rhyme": "ER", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "7", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, commen\u00e7ons la pri\u00e8re", "rhyme": "ER", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "AABBAABB", "rhyme_vowel": "AAAAAAAA"}, {"section_id": "section_3", "type": "couplet", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "La ranc\u0153ur se propage nous l'avons lu dans les nuages", "rhyme": "aZ", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Leur r\u00e8gne sans partage nous en connaissons les rouages", "rhyme": "aZ", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Ils se sont servis des incultes", "rhyme": "ylt", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Les humains les ont cru, leur victoire sonne comme une insulte", "rhyme": "ylt", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Nous avons choisi la transe et nous connaissons nos droits", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Vanit\u00e9, possession, nous n'y croyons pas", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "6", "text": "Le C.R.O.U. initial choisit la prose et l'hypnose", "rhyme": "oz", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "7", "text": "Bannir les chiens, telle est notre cause", "rhyme": "oz", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "AABBCCDD", "rhyme_vowel": "AABBAACC"}, {"section_id": "section_4", "type": "refrain", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, r\u00e9union des fid\u00e8les", "rhyme": "El", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, pour cr\u00e9er l'\u00e9tincelle", "rhyme": "El", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, saluons nos confr\u00e8res", "rhyme": "ER", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, commen\u00e7ons la pri\u00e8re", "rhyme": "ER", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, r\u00e9union des fid\u00e8les", "rhyme": "El", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "(- \"oh\", - \"Viens par ici\")", "rhyme": null, "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "6", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, pour cr\u00e9er l'\u00e9tincelle", "rhyme": "El", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "7", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, saluons nos confr\u00e8res", "rhyme": "ER", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "8", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, commen\u00e7ons la pri\u00e8re", "rhyme": "ER", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "AABBACABB", "rhyme_vowel": "AAAAABAAA"}, {"section_id": "section_5", "type": "couplet", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "La bastastelia n'en a pas fini de souffrir", "rhyme": "iR", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Nos divisions tuent n'ayons pas \u00e0 en rougir", "rhyme": "iR", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Nous sommes diff\u00e9rents nos id\u00e9es sont aux antipodes", "rhyme": "Od", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Oui nous les punirons ils ne sont que gast\u00e9ropodes", "rhyme": "Od", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Ils partent en randonn\u00e9e sans attendre les plus faibles", "rhyme": "Ebl", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Ne respectent rien, ni le bl\u00e9, ni le seigle", "rhyme": "Egl", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "6", "text": "Tellement facile de faire appel aux bas instincts", "rhyme": ")", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "7", "text": "Nous les traduirons au sein du Sinode Pibouin", "rhyme": ")", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "AABBCDEE", "rhyme_vowel": "AABBCCDD"}, {"section_id": "section_6", "type": "refrain", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, r\u00e9union des fid\u00e8les", "rhyme": "El", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, pour cr\u00e9er l'\u00e9tincelle", "rhyme": "El", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, saluons nos confr\u00e8res", "rhyme": "ER", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, commen\u00e7ons la pri\u00e8re", "rhyme": "ER", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, r\u00e9union des fid\u00e8les", "rhyme": "El", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Sinode Pibouin", "rhyme": ")", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "6", "text": "(- \"..yais-tu sinc\u00e8rement que la religion du Stup pouvait s'\u00e9teindre ?\")", "rhyme": null, "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "7", "text": "Sinode Pibouin", "rhyme": ")", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "8", "text": "Sinode Pibouin", "rhyme": ")", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "9", "text": "(- \"Non ma\u00eetre, jamais je n'ai eu de telles pens\u00e9es !\")", "rhyme": null, "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "AABBACDCCD", "rhyme_vowel": "AAAAABCBBC"}, {"section_id": "section_7", "type": "couplet", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Ils disent qu'ils redistribueront c'est ce qu'ils veulent te faire croire", "rhyme": "aR", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Mais tu n'auras acc\u00e8s ni aux soins ni au savoir", "rhyme": "aR", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Ils te reprocheront tes faiblesses, l'oisivet\u00e9", "rhyme": "e", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Ils te feront payer s'ils te surprennent \u00e0 m\u00e9diter", "rhyme": "e", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Nous les ha\u00efssons, mais nous resterons de marbre", "rhyme": "aRbR", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Nous les annihilerons par une seconde danse macabre", "rhyme": "abR", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "6", "text": "Nous serons tous pr\u00eats quand r\u00e9sonneront les cymbales", "rhyme": "al", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "7", "text": "Le Sinode Pibouin scellera leur pierres tombales", "rhyme": "al", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "AABBCDEE", "rhyme_vowel": "AABBAAAA"}, {"section_id": "section_8", "type": "refrain", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, r\u00e9union des fid\u00e8les", "rhyme": "El", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, pour cr\u00e9er l'\u00e9tincelle", "rhyme": "El", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, saluons nos confr\u00e8res", "rhyme": "ER", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, commen\u00e7ons la pri\u00e8re", "rhyme": "ER", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, r\u00e9union des fid\u00e8les", "rhyme": "El", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, pour cr\u00e9er l'\u00e9tincelle", "rhyme": "El", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "6", "text": "(- \"..yais-tu sinc\u00e8rement que la religion du Stup pouvait s'\u00e9teindre ?\")", "rhyme": null, "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "7", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, saluons nos confr\u00e8res", "rhyme": "ER", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "8", "text": "Sinode Pibouin, commen\u00e7ons la pri\u00e8re", "rhyme": "ER", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "9", "text": "(- \"Non ma\u00eetre !\")", "rhyme": null, "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhy